# Build discipline

- Implement **one phase at a time** per `docs/ROADMAP.md` dependency order.
- Read the phase file before coding; treat Out of scope as hard limits.
- Prefer extending existing modules over new parallel stacks.
- If acceptance criteria conflict with “ship API only”, update the phase file to require UI — do not silently drop the UI checkbox.
